    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "JUNE 1, 1947\nTWA\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINE\nSTATUE OF LIBERTY\nNEW YORK\n(Story on Page 2)",
      "Printed in US: A TWA Form No. 1-200\n-TWA\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINE\n9 Hours 50 Minutes\nCHICAGO\n*\nNEW YORK\nSAN F\nCISCO\nKANSAS CITY\nST. LOUIS\nLOS ANGELES\nStill Finest, Fastest Coast to Coast!\nTWA\nConstellation\nSERVICE\n*Los Angeles-New York. 11 hrs., 5 min. New York-Los Angeles.\nExtra fare now only ½ cent a mile\nFive Daily Roundtrips:\nNEW YORK - WEST COAST'\nNEW YORK - CHICAGO\nNew Non-Stop Constellation Flights:\nST. LOUIS - NEW YORK\nSAN FRANCISCO to KANSAS CITY\nMore Frequent Schedules:\nCHICAGO-LOS ANGELES; NEW YORK-SAN FRANCISCO\nCOMING SOON!\nDirect Non-Stop Constellation Service\nChicago - San Francisco\n* In addition, TWA operates 76 flights daily with DC-3's and\nBoeing Stratoliners, serving all cities on its vast transconti-\nnental system.\nNow TWA Welcomes\nLOUISVILLE\nNewest stop on the Trans World Airline.\n8 Flights daily beginning June 1 serving both coasts.\nReserve Early for Your Choice of Flights. See\nYour TWA Office or Your Favorite Travel Agent\n1020.087.029\nSCHEDULES ARE SUBIECT TO CHANGE WITHOUT NOTICE"
    ],
